{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37364","headline":"高平九日 · 唐彦谦","name":"高平九日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云净南山紫翠浮，凭陵绝顶望悠悠。\n偶逢佳节牵诗兴，漫把芳尊遣客愁。\n霜染鸦枫迎日醉，寒冲泾水带冰流。\n乌纱频岸西风里，笑插黄花满鬓秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}